  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the health and community systems for quality, equitable and timely service delivery - Uganda (01-Jul-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda, RSSH, The AIDS Support Organisation (Uganda) Limited (TASO)This program has the following goals: To strengthen the health and community systems for quality, equitable and timely service delivery. The objectives of this program are: Strengthen procurement and supply management capacity at national and sub-national levels to be able to sustain the national response to HIV, TB and malaria.  Strengthen the national health information and M&amp;E systems for evidence-based decision making for the HIV, TB and malaria response in Uganda.  To attain community empowerment to respond to the health needs and ensure social accountability and inclusiveness to achieve desired health outcome in Uganda</narrative>
  </description>
